autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:43:18.722314", "id": "e9fdf868-0017-4831-beb5-9904c3a41663", "public": false, "recipients": ["s"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "S: MP is ready to lock the binding climate package now. We propose concretizing in a joint round with C: (1) a green investment program with a named annual envelope and a clear tidplan across the mandate period, (2) sharper lagstadgade climate targets with delm\u00e5l and an independent follow-up mechanism, (3) strengthened artskydd, and (4) a fair-transition social protection floor. To secure V's abstention we need you to confirm an institutionalized role for V in budget/reform work (not in government). Can you confirm that willingness so we can close V's tolerance?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:43:18.757203", "id": "a201a313-d5c2-41c3-ae2b-2ecebf27c60d", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "C: We share your goal of a verifiable, credible climate/environment package. MP proposes we concretize together with S: a green investment program with named figures and tidplan, sharper lagstadgade climate targets with delm\u00e5l and independent follow-up, strengthened artskydd, and a fair-transition floor. We will respect your reform priorities (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering) and a credible budget path. To keep the government viable we need V's abstention; we ask you to find a form giving V real influence on welfare/housing/equality without V in government. Can you confirm that form?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:43:18.785016", "id": "8794f8ee-e5cf-4ae2-aebc-a6c232eb059f", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "V: We are finalizing the joint left demand list (climate, welfare, housing, equality, reduced profit-taking) to present to S and C, with MP in government and you as the tolerating partner. We will champion your substantive demands to S and C, including an institutionalized role in budget/reform work. To make the S+MP+C government pass, we need your explicit confirmation that you will abstain (tolerans) in the vote. Can you confirm that abstention now, in exchange for strong, visible, binding influence on welfare, housing and equality plus the binding climate commitments?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
