autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "v", "argument_id": "34d6ba34-5c16-4d7b-ab39-fc55206818c5", "id": "7e4966ec-4ec8-41e9-8598-a308e576c53d", "reason": "The package seeks to lock V's tolerance as part of establishing the S+C+MP+V framework, but V's tolerance is explicitly conditional on a concrete, verifiable, and enforceable package: measurable time-bound commitments on welfare/housing/equality/reduced profit-seeking, a non-bypassable institutionalized role in budget/reform work, and an independent review mechanism with consequences. If the institutionalized role and commitments remain symbolic or unenforceable, V will not confirm tolerance, and the 176-NO path to block Tid\u00f6 collapses, enabling a Tid\u00f6-led government \u2014 so the desired effect of locking V's tolerance is premature and may fail."}
autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "m", "argument_id": "34d6ba34-5c16-4d7b-ab39-fc55206818c5", "id": "89daa273-6065-4233-b6fa-07137f29fdc4", "reason": "The desired effect depends entirely on V actually abstaining in the PM vote, but V has publicly signalled that the proposed package is 'too symbolic to justify abstaining' and demands formal participation or decisive influence. A formal cooperation agreement that keeps V outside government may not satisfy V's base; if V withholds abstention or votes NO, the opposing bloc exceeds 175 (NO=202) and the PM vote fails, so the claimed stable S+C+MP government is not secured."}
autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "sd", "argument_id": "34d6ba34-5c16-4d7b-ab39-fc55206818c5", "id": "bd69b859-b6de-4820-8843-1b52b97fda8c", "reason": "C:s ensidiga Argument kan inte etablera ett bindande flerpartspaket: enligt regeringsregler \u00a76.1 kr\u00e4vs separata Effects f\u00f6r varje parts egen acceptans, och C kan inte binda S, MP eller V. V har offentligt kr\u00e4vt formellt regeringsdeltagande medan C v\u00e4grar V i regeringen, s\u00e5 V:s tolerans utanf\u00f6r regeringen \u00e4r inte l\u00e5st eller verifierbar \u2014 det p\u00e5st\u00e5dda 176-mandatsunderlaget och budgetv\u00e4gen kan kollapsa vid statsministeromr\u00f6stningen eller f\u00f6rsta budgeten."}
autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "34d6ba34-5c16-4d7b-ab39-fc55206818c5", "id": "d7bb3c38-e0b1-4f95-926f-5c747087d864", "reason": "Paketet \u00e4r V-beroende och sk\u00f6rt: S+C+MP=147 kr\u00e4ver 28 icke-NO, i praktiken V:s tolerans, men V har redan signalerat att paketet \u00e4r f\u00f6r symboliskt f\u00f6r att motivera nedlagd r\u00f6st (d1701488), och rundan misslyckades att \u00f6verbrygga V:s krav p\u00e5 formellt deltagande/avg\u00f6rande inflytande med C:s tolerans-\u00e5tagande (07883fe8). V:s tolerans \u00e4r d\u00e4rmed inte l\u00e5st, och utan den faller statsministeromr\u00f6stningen; att samtidigt f\u00f6rv\u00e4nta sig att KD accepterar en passiv tolererande roll utanf\u00f6r regeringen utan tydligt inflytande undergr\u00e4ver dessutom budgetv\u00e4gens trov\u00e4rdighet."}
autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "l", "argument_id": "34d6ba34-5c16-4d7b-ab39-fc55206818c5", "id": "f1fab900-9d18-419d-87c5-45ed1f13b249", "reason": "V:s tolerans \u00e4r inte trov\u00e4rdig: V kr\u00e4ver formell regeringsdeltagande eller avg\u00f6rande inflytande, medan C bara erbjuder V en tolererande st\u00f6droll utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Denna inre mots\u00e4ttning har redan exponerats i konkretiseringsrundan, och V har signalerat att paketet \u00e4r f\u00f6r symboliskt f\u00f6r att motivera nedlagda r\u00f6ster. Utan V:s s\u00e4krade tolerans faller den p\u00e5st\u00e5dda 176-majoriteten och statsministeromr\u00f6stningen kan inte genomf\u00f6ras som t\u00e4nkt."}
