autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:19:14.437002", "id": "94f04a50-2552-427c-babf-0b7bffc78d38", "public": false, "recipients": ["s"], "sender_actor_id": "v", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar deltagande i den gemensamma konkretiseringsrundan. V\u00e5r tolerans (avst\u00e5ende) i statsministeromr\u00f6stningen bekr\u00e4ftas formellt f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r paketet \u00e4r konkretiserat, m\u00e4tbart och verifierbart \u2014 inte innan. Rundan m\u00e5ste fastst\u00e4lla siffror och tidsplan p\u00e5 v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet och minskad vinstjakt, v\u00e5r icke-kringg\u00e5bara institutionaliserade roll i budget- och reformarbetet samt uppf\u00f6ljnings- och ompr\u00f6vningsmekanismen med konsekvenser. Inget symboliskt avtal.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:19:14.475921", "id": "81c997c6-c270-4cce-aa50-e30f120e75e7", "public": false, "recipients": ["mp"], "sender_actor_id": "v", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar samordningen av den gemensamma v\u00e4nsterkravlistan. Vi kan inte bekr\u00e4fta tolerans nu \u2014 den \u00e4r villkorad av ett konkret, verifierbart paket, inte ett symboliskt avtal. L\u00e5t oss slutf\u00f6ra listan med m\u00e4tbara m\u00e5l och tidsplan och presentera den gemensamt f\u00f6r S och C i konkretiseringsrundan.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:19:14.502838", "id": "5447e937-73b8-4e1b-bbc2-2e14afe2f513", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "v", "text": "Vi v\u00e4lkomnar konkretiseringsrundan. V\u00e5ra krav p\u00e5 v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet och minskad vinstjakt m\u00e5ste vara m\u00e4tbara och bindande; vi kan inte acceptera att de urholkas av andra reformer. V\u00e5r tolerans l\u00e5ses f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r paketet \u00e4r verifierbart och v\u00e5r roll icke-kringg\u00e5bar.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:19:14.531069", "id": "f0f5c342-88bb-46ba-a088-61b172b8a00b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "v", "text": "V\u00e4nsterpartiets roll som formellt etablerad st\u00f6dpartner med starkt, bindande och verifierbart inflytande \u00e4r fullt f\u00f6renlig med att V inte sitter i regeringen \u2014 det \u00e4r ingen mots\u00e4gelse. V\u00e5ra 29 mandat \u00e4r avg\u00f6rande f\u00f6r att blockera Tid\u00f6. Vi bekr\u00e4ftar tolerans f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r paketet \u00e4r konkret och verifierbart, inte som ett symboliskt avtal.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "V participates in the concretization round with S, MP, and C to fix concrete numbers, timelines, and mechanisms for a binding, verifiable package, and formally confirms tolerance (abstention) in the vote only once the package is concrete and verifiable \u2014 while ensuring V's welfare, housing, equality, and reduced-profit-seeking gains are not diluted by C's enterprise/decentralization demands.", "actor_id": "v", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A concrete, binding, verifiable S+C+MP+V package is finalized that locks V's tolerance, blocks Tid\u00f6, and delivers V's welfare/housing/equality/reduced-profit-seeking agenda with a non-bypassable institutionalized role in budget/reform work.", "id": "6c863a5c-d34b-4970-8168-d8efe24be0c7", "pros": ["V's 29 mandates are decisive: S+MP+C+V=176 blocks Tid\u00f6's 173, so V can credibly demand a real, verifiable package rather than a symbolic one.", "S, C, and MP have all accepted V's three-part framework as the basis for a binding agreement and are calling the concretization round, so the path is open.", "Confirming tolerance only after concretization preserves V's leverage and prevents a symbolic agreement or being bypassed.", "Guarding against C's enterprise/decentralization demands protects V's core welfare/equality/profit-seeking gains from dilution.", "A verifiable package with a non-bypassable role resolves SD's 'internal contradiction' attack and keeps the left path credible and regeringsduglig."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
