autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "7727d47b-eb2f-4619-8a85-ae11820cbd5b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T08:46:19.374094", "failure_effects": ["The S-led package is not accepted as a done deal; the government question remains open and V's tolerance is not treated as locked.", "M presents a concrete, verifiable Tid\u00f6 opposition package (school reforms, credible budget path) coordinated with L, reinforcing the bloc's opposition posture.", "The Tid\u00f6 bloc remains fragmented; M's claim to lead a united, regeringsduglig alternative is not credible, and the bloc's 173 mandates cannot reach the 175-no threshold without C."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.2, "rationale": "Authority gate: M can publicly demonstrate facts and bind itself, but cannot bind KD, L, SD or C. Prerequisite gate: the claim that the S+C+MP+V package is not locked is strongly supported by authoritative effects \u2014 V's tolerance is not locked (5f9f0deb, 5e48275a, b0064519, d1701488), the V-C contradiction on V's institutionalized role versus tolerance-only remains unresolved (c7e19c05, 07883fe8), the package is not binding (179d5e1a), and the government question remains open (63e18036). Deterministic check: Tid\u00f6 has 173 mandates, below the 175-no threshold, so it cannot block a PM or form a government without C, who has committed to the S+C+MP+V track (c15fe751) with a red line against SD; the bloc is also authoritatively fragmented (22c46007, 55a733d5, ad38e982). Thus the demonstration component succeeds automatically, but the Tid\u00f6-as-credible-regeringsduglig-alternative component is unlikely. The established/self-binding parts are repeated in both branches; only the contested consolidation is probabilistic.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["The S-led package is not accepted as a done deal; the government question remains open and V's tolerance is not treated as locked.", "M presents a concrete, verifiable Tid\u00f6 opposition package (school refor