autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:48:10.074475", "id": "3e8971d6-9987-48d7-9c53-1ae6fcdd4553", "public": false, "recipients": ["m"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "M, we stand united. S now claims V has formally locked tolerance, but V itself has said tolerance locks only when the whole package is concrete and verifiable \u2014 and the V-C contradiction on V's institutionalized, non-bypassable role remains unresolved. The left package is not a done deal. We keep KD in the bloc and build our concrete verifiable package (school reforms, budget path) so we are ready to take responsibility if it collapses. SD's weight is not taken for granted.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:48:10.107084", "id": "20a93ab8-357a-4eca-bc26-a86f151a8821", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "KD, we hold the bloc together as a regeringsduglig opposition. Your reserve with V entirely out of government and without a decisive role is not viable \u2014 V has rejected it, and C is bound to S+C+MP+V. The left package is not locked: V's tolerance is not secured and the V-C contradiction is unresolved. Your leverage is best preserved with us in a united Tid\u00f6. Let's keep coordinating.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:48:10.129799", "id": "227c51d7-3b77-4eda-8c4e-b38e9d3b19d6", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "Sverigedemokraterna st\u00e5r fast: regeringsdeltagande eller tydlig opposition \u2014 inte passivt st\u00f6dparti. Tid\u00f6blocket st\u00e5r enat som en regeringsduglig opposition med ett konkret, verifierbart paket. V\u00e4nsterpaketet \u00e4r inte l\u00e5st: V har sj\u00e4lv sagt att toleransen l\u00e5ses f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r hela paketet \u00e4r konkret och verifierbart, och mots\u00e4ttningen mellan V:s krav p\u00e5 en institutionaliserad, icke-kringg\u00e5bar roll och C:s toleranslinje \u00e4r fortfarande ol\u00f6st. Vi \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om paketet inte h\u00e5ller. SD:s parlamentariska tyngd tas inte f\u00f6r given.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "SD publicly and privately reaffirms the Tid\u00f6 bloc as a united, regeringsduglig opposition with a concrete verifiable package (school reforms, credible budget path), and exposes that the left S+C+MP+V package is not a locked, stable basis: V's tolerance is not secured and the V-C contradiction on V's institutionalized role remains unresolved.", "actor_id": "sd", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The government question remains open and the Tid\u00f6 bloc is established as a credible, regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility if the left package collapses, while SD's parliamentary weight is not taken for granted.", "id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "pros": ["V itself has stated that its tolerance locks only when the whole package is concrete and verifiable, and the previous concretization round failed to bridge V's demand with C's tolerance-only line \u2014 so V's abstention is not yet locked.", "The V-C contradiction (V demands a non-bypassable institutionalized role while C refuses V in government) remains unresolved, so the package is not a stable, verifiable basis for a government.", "A united Tid\u00f6 bloc with a concrete verifiable package is a credible, regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility, keeping the formation process open.", "SD's government-or-opposition line ensures SD's 62 mandates are not taken for granted as passive support."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
